### Health
GET http://localhost:8080/health

### List jobs
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/jobs

### Filter ready loafers
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/jobs?status=READY&footwear=loafer

### Create intake job
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "LW-210",
  "customer": "Sam Ortega",
  "footwear": "pump",
  "leather": "patent",
  "issue": "Broken heel stem",
  "cobbler": "Jordan Lee",
  "dueOn": "2026-09-01",
  "status": "INTAKE",
  "notes": "Keep spare lifts.",
  "tags": ["dress", "rush"]
}

### Last
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/jobs/{{jobId}}/last

### Stitch
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/jobs/{{jobId}}/stitch

### Finish
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/jobs/{{jobId}}/finish

### Ready
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/jobs/{{jobId}}/ready

### Pickup
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/jobs/{{jobId}}/pickup

### Update notes
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/jobs/{{jobId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "notes": "Picked up with receipt."
}

### Delete
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/jobs/{{jobId}}
